   "stop_reason": "All three questions have been addressed as far as the available actions allow, and no remaining action can change a verdict or improve the export. Q-1: S-Q1-03 is complete (resu-00240) with six required arms and four required paired diagnostics on the same 750 validation rows (row_hash 260db427...); the physics box-clipped log-space MLE (val rel_l2 0.01933 at both seeds) beats extra_trees (0.0774/0.0771) and torch_mlp (0.0280/0.0302) at both matched seeds, with lower 95% paired-bootstrap bounds 0.728/0.727 and 0.272/0.318, all above the 0.10 margin under the pre-registered conjunctive rule. The verdicts remain 'inconclusive' solely because the independent critic has accepted no objection resolution: two resolve_objection attempts (action-008, action-009) were rejected, four specialist delegations (task-001 to task-004) returned 'no executable study' well inside their time limits, and the child-depth limit now binds, so the optimizer-adequacy, clipping, CFL and Fisher items (objections 018/025/036-040/044/053) stay as acknowledged uncertainty. Partial support exists in the arm fit_reports: residual_std_at_truth 0.000995 vs sigma 0.001, model_mismatch=false, chi2/dof 0.963, forward evals 174,077 of 3,000,000, 1-sigma/2-sigma coverage 0.702/0.957. Q-2: S-Q2-01's 'contradicted' verdict is void (treatment silently normalised to 'mode', identical effective hash, self-paired artifacts). S-Q2-02 ran the genuine posterior-mean contrast: rel_l2 0.019047 vs 0.019334, relative effect 1.5% with interval [-0.25%, 3.4%], inconclusive at the 2% margin and establishing neither superiority nor equivalence (objection-108). S-Q2-03 ran the hybrid (torch_mlp init + 10 LM iterations): rel_l2 0.019343 vs 0.019334, degradation interval upper bound 0.14% against the 2% margin, at 47,936 forward evals versus 174,077, but blocked by unresolved critic objections. Q-3: per-target evidence is consistent across every arm: outer segments k1/k4 have rel_l2 about 0.027 versus 0.005-0.006 for the central segments, roughly 4-5x worse, matching the expectation that the centred pulse deposits little energy near the Dirichlet ends; the local Fisher diagnostic was never produced and is recorded as an open item, not as a result. Synthesis framing must keep every qualifier: inverse-crime (exact forward model), simulator access versus 3000 training rows, fixed-configuration untuned baselines, single or two seeds with no seed-variance estimate, row-resampling-only bootstrap with n_bootstrap=200, development split only. Budget: 217 s of 760 s used, 543 s remaining, forward evals far under the cap. Export is the best executed full-fidelity arm by validation rel_l2, which is the S-Q2-02 posterior_mean arm (0.019047, resu-00348), with the S-Q1-03 physics mode arm (0.019334) as the pre-registered default; the difference between them is not statistically established. Nothing here certifies a claim; verdicts remain with the executor and critic.",
